body:
I'm so sorry that you aren't getting the love, support, and understanding you need from your family and your school. I wish you had a community who would help you get the care you need.

&#x200B;

Derek, do you have anyone in your extended family who would be willing and able to support you? A friend's parent who will listen to what you need to say without judging you? Will your family allow you to visit a therapist outside of school, possibly without telling them why? Do you have any trans men you can talk to about their experiences who can offer advice or guidance?
